This is a game that is designed to develop memory and logical thinking. It consists of many levels, each of which is a set of puzzles of varying difficulty. The player must memorize the location of certain objects on the screen and then return to them to complete the task.
The graphics in the game are simple but stylish. All objects are made in bright colors, which makes the game more enjoyable. The musical accompaniment is unobtrusive and helps you focus on completing the levels.
Advantages of the game:
Development of memory and logical thinking;
Simple but stylish graphics;
Good musical accompaniment.
